==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-Amazon lily.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[bulbous]] [[plant]], ''[[Eucharis amazonica]]'', of the [[family]] [[Amaryllidaceae]], having tight, compact [[rosette]]s of [[glossy]] green leaves and tall spikes of white, [[fragrant]] flowers.
# A [[giant]] [[water lily]], {{taxlink|Victoria amazonica|species}}, with circular leaves of up to 8 feet in [[diameter]] having large white [[female]] flowers that [[bloom]] at night, and change to pink [[male]] ones the next night.

